Kevin Costner

Kevin Costner ingkang gadhah asma lair Kevin Michael Costner, lair ing &lt;a href="Lynwood"&gt;Lynwood&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="California"&gt;California&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Januari"&gt;Januari&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="1955"&gt;1955&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun miwiti karir dados aktor, prodhuser, lan ugi dados sutradara. Aktingipun dadosaken piyambakipun misuwur ing karakter Crash Davis ing filem &lt;a href="BULL%20DURHAM"&gt;BULL DURHAM&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="1988"&gt;1988&lt;/a&gt;).
Film ingkang misuwur sapanunggalanipun inggih punika DANCE WITH WOLVES (&lt;a href="1990"&gt;1990&lt;/a&gt;), THE UNTOUCHABLES, BULL DURHAM, FIELD OF DREAMS, ROBIN HOOD: PRICE OF THIEVES, JFK, THE GUARDIAN, lan MR. BROOKS. Saking filem DANCE WITH WOLVES (1990) piyambakipun dados Best Director lan Best Picture &lt;a href="Academy%20Awards"&gt;Academy Awards&lt;/a&gt; (Oscar).
Costner naté krama kaping kalih. Garwanipun ingkang satunggal inggih punika &lt;a href="Cindy%20Silva"&gt;Cindy Silva&lt;/a&gt;, lan pegatan ing taun &lt;a href="1994"&gt;1994&lt;/a&gt;. Selajengipun punika piyambakipun krama kaliyan &lt;a href="Christine%20Baumgarter"&gt;Christine Baumgarter&lt;/a&gt; lan gadhah lare &lt;a href="Cayden%20Wyatt%20Costner"&gt;Cayden Wyatt Costner&lt;/a&gt;.
Sawekdal krama kaliyan &lt;a href="Cindy%20Silva"&gt;Cindy Silva&lt;/a&gt;, Costner gadhah tiga lare inggih punika &lt;a href="Joe%20Costner"&gt;Joe Costner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lily%20Costner"&gt;Lily Costner&lt;/a&gt;, lan &lt;a href="Annie%20Costner"&gt;Annie Costner&lt;/a&gt;. Manawi saking &lt;a href="Bridget%20Rooney"&gt;Bridget Rooney&lt;/a&gt;, gadhah lare, &lt;a href="Liam%20Rooney"&gt;Liam Rooney&lt;/a&gt;.
