Lumrahé wong Turk iku asalé saka &lt;a href="Asia%20Tengah"&gt;Asia Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, kaya ta ing papan &lt;a href="Pagunungan%20Altai"&gt;Pagunungan Altai&lt;/a&gt;. Saiki Wong Turk wis kasebar ing &lt;a href="Asia%20Tengah"&gt;Asia Tengah&lt;/a&gt;, Ujung &lt;a href="Anatolia"&gt;Anatolia&lt;/a&gt;, Laladan &lt;a href="Balkan"&gt;Balkan&lt;/a&gt;, Padhang &lt;a href="Siberia"&gt;Sibèri&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa%20W%C3%A9tan"&gt;Éropa Wétan&lt;/a&gt;.
Makna barès saka tembung Turk iku piranti kanggo njaga &lt;a href="sirah"&gt;sirah&lt;/a&gt;, nanging bisa uga asal saka tembung Tur, ya iku putuné &lt;a href="Nuh"&gt;Nabi Nuh&lt;/a&gt;. 
Saiki ana 6 nagara Turk kang duwé kadhaulatan, ya iku &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Azerbaijan"&gt;Azerbaijan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kazakhstan"&gt;Kazakhstan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kirgizstan"&gt;Kirgizstan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Turkmenistan"&gt;Turkmenistan&lt;/a&gt; &amp; &lt;a href="Uzbekistan"&gt;Uzbekistan&lt;/a&gt;. Ana uga laladan sub-nasional kang dipanggoni déning Wong Turk kaya ta &lt;a href="Tatarstan"&gt;Tatarstan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bashkortostan"&gt;Bashkortostan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Chuvashia"&gt;Chuvashia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Sakha"&gt;Sakha&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Karachay-Cherkessia"&gt;Karachay-Cherkessia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Kabardino-Balkaria"&gt;Kabardino-Balkaria&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Khakassia"&gt;Khakassia&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tuva"&gt;Tuva&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Gagauzia"&gt;Gagauzia&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Moldova"&gt;Moldova&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Krimea"&gt;Krimea&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Ukraina"&gt;Ukraina&lt;/a&gt; uga &lt;a href="Xinjiang"&gt;Xinjiang&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Cina"&gt;Républik Rakyat Cina&lt;/a&gt;. Kazakhstan iku nagara Turk kang papané paling amba, nanging &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt; iku nagara Turk kang paling akèh wargané.
