<li>Pujian &lt;a href="Syaikh%20%27Abdul-Aziz%20bin%20Baz"&gt;Syaikh 'Abdul-Aziz bin Baz&lt;/a&gt; rahimahullah; Aku ora tau weruh sawijining &lt;a href="ulama"&gt;ulama&lt;/a&gt; ing sangisore longan langit iki, ing abad modhèren iki kaya &lt;a href="al-Allamah%20Muhammad%20Nashiruddin%20al-Albani"&gt;al-Allamah Muhammad Nashiruddin al-Albani&lt;/a&gt;.”</li>
