Ferry Rotinsulu (#ALIH). Ferry Rotinsulu punika salah satunggaling kiper &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Sapunika Ferry Rotinsulu main wonten klub Liga &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Sriwijaya%20F.C."&gt;Sriwijaya F.C.&lt;/a&gt;. Ferry Rotinsulu nginggilipun &lt;a href="182"&gt;182&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="cm"&gt;cm&lt;/a&gt;. Ferry Rotinsulu saded ndadosaken "Laskar Wong Kito" utawi &lt;a href="Sriwijaya%20F.C"&gt;Sriwijaya F.C&lt;/a&gt; dados jawara wonten ing &lt;a href="Piala%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Piala Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; nalika taun &lt;a href="2007"&gt;2007&lt;/a&gt; sasampunipun final wonten ing &lt;a href="Stadion%20Gelora%20Bung%20Karno"&gt;Stadion Gelora Bung Karno&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jakarta"&gt;Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika samanten Sriwijaya Football Club saged ngalahaken klub ingkang asalipun saking &lt;a href="Papua"&gt;Papua&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Persipura%20Jayapura"&gt;Persipura Jayapura&lt;/a&gt; lumantar adu penalti kanthi skor 3-0. Wonten ing babak adu &lt;a href="penalti"&gt;penalti&lt;/a&gt; Ferry Rotinsulu saged ngalangi tendangan juru main &lt;a href="Persipura"&gt;Persipura&lt;/a&gt; ingkang namanipun &lt;a href="David%20Da%20Rocha"&gt;David Da Rocha&lt;/a&gt; saha &lt;a href="Eduard%20Ivakdalam"&gt;Eduard Ivakdalam&lt;/a&gt;. Sadèrèngipun wonten babak semifinal, nalika babak adu penalti, Ferry ugi saged nepis tendangan juru main &lt;a href="Pelita%20Jaya%20Purwakarta"&gt;Pelita Jaya Purwakarta&lt;/a&gt; inggih punika &lt;a href="Ardan%20Aras"&gt;Ardan Aras&lt;/a&gt; saha &lt;a href="Vagner%20Luis"&gt;Vagner Luis&lt;/a&gt;. Nanging sanajan ingkang kapilih dados juru main ingkang saé piyambak wonten ing &lt;a href="Copa%20Indonesia%202007"&gt;Copa Indonesia 2007&lt;/a&gt;. Déné kang dados juru main paling apik inggih punika &lt;a href="Bambang%20Pamungkas"&gt;Bambang Pamungkas&lt;/a&gt;.
