Karir.
Sapunika Zulkifly syukur main wonten &lt;a href="Persib%20Bandung"&gt;Persib Bandung&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Liga%20Super%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Liga Super Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, sadéréngipun punika, Zulkifly Syukur naté main wonten ing &lt;a href="Arema%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Arema Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Persmin%20Minahasa"&gt;Persmin Minahasa&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pelita%20Jaya"&gt;Pelita Jaya&lt;/a&gt;, saha klub bal-balan &lt;a href="PKT%20Bontang"&gt;PKT Bontang&lt;/a&gt;. Zulkifly punika salah satunggaling juru main &lt;a href="timnas%20U-23"&gt;timnas U-23&lt;/a&gt; ingkang ndhèrèk TC wonten ing Walanda arahan &lt;a href="Foppe%20de%20Han"&gt;Foppe de Han&lt;/a&gt; saha &lt;a href="Bambang%20Nurdiansyah"&gt;Bambang Nurdiansyah&lt;/a&gt;. Zulkifly Syukur limrahipun dados &lt;a href="b%C3%A9k"&gt;bék&lt;/a&gt;. Kajawi punika, Zulkifly syukur ugi dados juru main ingkang wigati wonten ing &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20sepak%20bola%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;timnas Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; nalika &lt;a href="Piala%20Suzuki%20AFF%202010"&gt;AFF Suzuki Cup 2010&lt;/a&gt; asuhan &lt;a href="Alfred%20Riedl"&gt;Alfred Riedl&lt;/a&gt;. Zulkifli Syukur punika bék sayap Arema Indonésia ingkang dados juru main timnas nalika &lt;a href="Piala%20AFF%202010"&gt;Piala AFF 2010&lt;/a&gt;.
Zulfikly naté bingung tumrap &lt;a href="PSSI"&gt;PSSI&lt;/a&gt; ingkang boten tegas tumrap status juru main timnas. Nalika samanten, &lt;a href="PSSI"&gt;PSSI&lt;/a&gt; sadéréngipun nedahaken yèn boten nampi juru main ingkang main wonten ing &lt;a href="Liga%20Primer%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Liga Primer Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; (LPI), nanging PSSI malah nimbali juru main LPI kanggé mlebet seleksi &lt;a href="timnas%20u23"&gt;timnas u23&lt;/a&gt; nagara Indonésia. Kajawi punika &lt;a href="Muhammad%20Ridwan"&gt;Muhammad Ridwan&lt;/a&gt;, juru main &lt;a href="Tangerang"&gt;Tangerang&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Wolves"&gt;Wolves&lt;/a&gt; ingkang main ugi wonten ing LPI malah saged mlebet pratélan &lt;a href="26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt; nama skuat timnas u23 Indonésia pra-Olimpiade &lt;a href="2012"&gt;2012&lt;/a&gt;. Zulkifli ngakeni bingung kaliyan standar ganda PSSI.
