Mboten kirang saking &lt;a href="70"&gt;70&lt;/a&gt; filem layar ageng sampun dipunlintangi déning aktor ingkang dados tokoh Tony Stark ing sekuel &lt;a href="IRON%20MAN"&gt;IRON MAN&lt;/a&gt; taun 2010.
Ing taun &lt;a href="2008"&gt;2008&lt;/a&gt;, Downey sampun gadhah kathah pujian ing filem &lt;a href="TROPIC%20THUNDER"&gt;TROPIC THUNDER&lt;/a&gt;. Piyambakipun gadhah nominasi kanggé kategori &lt;a href="Best%20Supporting%20Actor"&gt;Best Supporting Actor&lt;/a&gt; kanggé tokoh Kirk Lazarus ing &lt;a href="Golden%20Globe%20Award"&gt;Golden Globe Award&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Academy%20Award"&gt;Academy Award&lt;/a&gt;.
