<h2>Guru-gurune</h2>
Guru-gurune.
Ing kutha &lt;a href="Baghdad"&gt;Baghdad&lt;/a&gt;, dhèwèké ngangsu kawruh marang ulama-ulama kaya:
<ol>
<li>&lt;a href="Al-Imam%20Abu%20Yusuf"&gt;Al-Imam Abu Yusuf&lt;/a&gt;, murid seniore &lt;a href="Al-Imam%20Abu%20Hanifah"&gt;Al-Imam Abu Hanifah&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="Al-Imam%20Husyaim%20bin%20Abi%20Basyir"&gt;Al-Imam Husyaim bin Abi Basyir&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
<li>&lt;a href="%E2%80%98Umair%20bin%20Abdillah%20bin%20Khalid"&gt;‘Umair bin Abdillah bin Khalid&lt;/a&gt;</<li>
