<li>&lt;a href="Abu%20Bakr%20bin%20%E2%80%98Ayyasy"&gt;Abu Bakr bin ‘Ayyasy&lt;/a&gt;.</<li>
</ol>
Al-Imam Adz Dzahabi jronng kitab &lt;a href="As-Siyar"&gt;As-Siyar&lt;/a&gt;, nyebutake jumlah guru-gurune Al-Imam Ahmad kang diriwayatke sajeroning Musnad punjul 280.
