<doc id="81704" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=81704" title="Mathias Ibo">
Mathias Ibo

Mathias Ibo (#ALIH). Mathias Ibo punika salah satunggaling &lt;a href="fisioterapis"&gt;fisioterapis&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="bal"&gt;bal&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Ibo punika &lt;a href="fisioterapis"&gt;fisioterapis&lt;/a&gt; ingkang sepisanan wonten ing &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Tim nasional bal-balan Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; saha persepakbolaan Indonésia. Mathias Ibo punika gadhah katurunan campuran &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt;. Sapunika, Mathias Ibo dipunpitados kaliyan &lt;a href="Badan%20Tim%20Nasional"&gt;Badan Tim Nasional&lt;/a&gt; (BTN) kanggé njabat dados fisioterapis &lt;a href="Tim%20nasional%20bal-balan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Tim nasional bal-balan Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Sadèrèngipun, timnas namung ngendelaken &lt;a href="dhokter"&gt;dhokter&lt;/a&gt; tim saha tukang pijet kanggé juru main ingkang &lt;a href="kesl%C3%A9o"&gt;kesléo&lt;/a&gt;.
Mathias Ibo punika lulusan saking &lt;a href="Universitas%20Thim%20Van%20Der%20Laan"&gt;Universitas Thim Van Der Laan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Utrecht"&gt;Utrecht&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Walanda"&gt;Walanda&lt;/a&gt;. Mathias Ibo kuliyah wonten ing jurusan sport physiotherapists. Mathias ngakeni mlebet wonten ing timnas nalika kundur dhumateng kampung wonten ing kluwarganipun ing &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kitha&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Malang"&gt;Malang&lt;/a&gt;. Mathias Ibo lajeng dipuntembung kaliyan &lt;a href="Iman%20Arif"&gt;Iman Arif&lt;/a&gt;, Ketua &lt;a href="BTN"&gt;BTN&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="PSSI"&gt;PSSI&lt;/a&gt; supados nyambut damel wonten ing Timnas Indonésia.
Mathias Ibo naté sekolah wonten ing &lt;a href="Tk%20Panca%20Setya%20Sintang"&gt;Tk Panca Setya Sintang&lt;/a&gt;, SD/SMP Immanuel, &lt;a href="SMUK%20St%20Albertus"&gt;SMUK St Albertus&lt;/a&gt; (Dempo), &lt;a href="Belfast%20Bible%20College"&gt;Belfast Bible College&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="International%20Academie%20Physiotherapy%20Thim%20van%20der%20Laan%20Utrecht%20The%20Netherlands"&gt;International Academie Physiotherapy Thim van der Laan Utrecht The Netherlands&lt;/a&gt;. Mathias Ibo lajeng nikah kaliyan &lt;a href="Olivia%20Latuputty"&gt;Olivia Latuputty&lt;/a&gt;.
Mathias Ibo gadhah kepénginan kanggé ndamel pusat réhabilitasi kanggé atlèt saha juru main bal ingkang cedera ing Indonésia.
