<doc id="81707" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=81707" title="Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto">
Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto

Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto lair wonten ing dhusun &lt;a href="Kalinegoro"&gt;Kalinegoro&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Kabupat%C3%A8n%20Magelang"&gt;Kabupatèn Magelang&lt;/a&gt;. Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto punika salah satunggaling &lt;a href="bal-balan"&gt;juru main bal-balan&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;. Kurniawan punika kalebet salah satunggaling juru main &lt;a href="bal"&gt;bal&lt;/a&gt; ingkang saé piyambak ingkang dipungadhahi nagara Indonésia. Kurniawan naté main wonten ing &lt;a href="Persela%20Lamongan"&gt;Persela Lamongan&lt;/a&gt; nalika ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia%20Super%20League"&gt;Indonésia Super League&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika taun &lt;a href="2010"&gt;2010&lt;/a&gt;, Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto main wonten ing klub kebanggaan masarakat &lt;a href="Tangerang"&gt;Tangerang&lt;/a&gt; inggih punika &lt;a href="Tangerang%20Wolves"&gt;Tangerang Wolves&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Indon%C3%A9sia%20Premiere%20League"&gt;Indonésia Premiere League&lt;/a&gt;. Kurniawan punika salah satunggaling juru main Indonésia ingkang naté main ing &lt;a href="%C3%89ropa"&gt;Éropa&lt;/a&gt;. Nalika wiwitan kariripun, Kurniawan naté main wonten ing tim ném-néman &lt;a href="U.C.%20Sampdoria"&gt;Sampdoria&lt;/a&gt; sadéréngipun Kurniawan pindhah wonten ing &lt;a href="FC%20Luzern"&gt;FC Luzern&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Switserlan"&gt;Switserlan&lt;/a&gt; amargi wonten masalah kaliyan &lt;a href="PSSI"&gt;PSSI&lt;/a&gt;.
Kurniawan asring dipuntimbali kaliyan nama "Ade". Kajawi punika, Kurniawan ugi naté dipunjuluki kanthi jeneng Kurus. Punika amarga awakipun ingkang alit. Kurniawan Dwi Yulianto ugi naté main wonten ing tim-tim ing Indonésia kados ta &lt;a href="PSM%20Makassar"&gt;PSM Makassar&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="PSPS%20Pekanbaru"&gt;PSPS Pekanbaru&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Pelita%20Krakatau%20Steel"&gt;PS Pelita Bakrie&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Persebaya%20Surabaya"&gt;Persebaya Surabaya&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;a href="Persija%20Jakarta"&gt;Persija Jakarta&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Persitara%20Jakarta%20Utara"&gt;Persitara Jakarta Utara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Persela%20Lamongan"&gt;Persela Lamongan&lt;/a&gt;, lan sapunika main wonten ing &lt;a href="PSMS%20Medan"&gt;PSMS Medan&lt;/a&gt;. Antawisipun wulan &lt;a href="Dh%C3%A9s%C3%A8mber"&gt;Dhésèmber&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2005"&gt;2005&lt;/a&gt; dumugi &lt;a href="M%C3%A8i"&gt;Mèi&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2006"&gt;2006&lt;/a&gt;, Kurniawan main ing &lt;a href="Sarawak%20FC"&gt;Sarawak FC&lt;/a&gt; wonten ing &lt;a href="Malaysia"&gt;Malaysia&lt;/a&gt;, nanging amarga jarang ndamel gol Kurniawan lajeng putus kontrak.
Karir Kurniawan naté surut amargi &lt;a href="narkoba"&gt;narkoba&lt;/a&gt; nalika akir taun &lt;a href="1990-an"&gt;1990-an&lt;/a&gt;, nanging Kurniawan lajeng saged misuwur malih ing kariripun. Sapunika Kurniawan dados juru main ingkang saged ndamel &lt;a href="gol"&gt;gol&lt;/a&gt; ingkang kathah piyambak nomer kalih wonten ing &lt;a href="timnas%20bal-balan%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;timnas bal-balan Indonésia&lt;/a&gt; kanthi gol kang cacahipun &lt;a href="31"&gt;31&lt;/a&gt; gol sasampunipun &lt;a href="Bambang%20Pamungkas"&gt;Bambang Pamungkas&lt;/a&gt; kanthi &lt;a href="34"&gt;34&lt;/a&gt; gol.
Kurniawan nikah kaliyan &lt;a href="Kartika%20Dewi"&gt;Kartika Dewi&lt;/a&gt; saha gadhah satunggal putra.
