<doc id="81928" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=81928" title="Abdullah bin Abdulkadir Munsyi">
Abdullah bin Abdulkadir Munsyi

Abdullah bin Abdulkadir Munsyi (Munshi) (&lt;a href="Malaka"&gt;Malaka&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1796"&gt;1796&lt;/a&gt;-&lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1854"&gt;1854&lt;/a&gt; (biyèn &lt;a href="Turki"&gt;Turki&lt;/a&gt; saiki &lt;a href="Arab%20Saudi"&gt;Arab Saudi&lt;/a&gt;) iku sastrawan &lt;a href="sastra%20Melayu"&gt;Melayu&lt;/a&gt;.
Abdullah iku pranakan &lt;a href="Bangsa%20Arab"&gt;Arab&lt;/a&gt; lan &lt;a href="Tamil"&gt;Tamil&lt;/a&gt;, nanging diwasa ing budaya &lt;a href="Melayu"&gt;Melayu&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Melaka"&gt;Melaka&lt;/a&gt;, kang wektu iku isih dijajah &lt;a href="Britania"&gt;Britania&lt;/a&gt;. Abdullah nyambut gawé minangka guru basa (munsyi). Wiwitané Abdullah mulang &lt;a href="basa%20Melayu"&gt;basa Melayu&lt;/a&gt; marang bala keturunan &lt;a href="India"&gt;India&lt;/a&gt; ing garnisun Melaka, lan sabanjuré marang para misionaris, punggawa lan pebisnis Britania lan &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;. Abdullah tau nyambut gawé marang &lt;a href="Thomas%20Stamford%20Raffles"&gt;Thomas Stamford Raffles&lt;/a&gt; minangka juru tulis, nerjemahaké &lt;a href="Injil"&gt;Injil&lt;/a&gt; sarta tèks &lt;a href="agama%20Kristen"&gt;agama Kristen&lt;/a&gt; liyané kanggo London Missionary Society ing Malaka, lan dadi wong kang nyithak American Board of Missions ing &lt;a href="Singapura"&gt;Singapura&lt;/a&gt;.
Abdullah tilar donya ing &lt;a href="Mekah"&gt;Mekah&lt;/a&gt;, kemungkinan amarga lelara &lt;a href="kolera"&gt;kolera&lt;/a&gt;, nalika arep ngayahi ngibadah &lt;a href="kaji"&gt;kaji&lt;/a&gt;.
